flowchart LR
  subgraph EXT[Consumidores externos]
    WEB[Frontend Maneja de Una]
    BOOKING[Booking Prototipo]
    ADMIN[Panel administrativo]
  end

  GW[API Gateway\nREST /api/v1 · /api/v2 · /api/v3\nJWT/API key · rate limit · correlation · ProblemDetails]

  WEB --> GW
  ADMIN --> GW
  BOOKING -->|REST OpenAPI v3| GW

  subgraph DOM[Dominios provisionales de la tienda]
    ID[ms_identity\nusuarios · roles · tokens]
    CAT[ms_catalog\nmarca · modelo · categoría · media]
    INV[ms_inventory\nunidad física · holds · disponibilidad\nestado · cooldown]
    ORD[ms_order\nPNR · reserva · snapshots · idempotencia]
    CNT[ms_counter\ncheck-in · entrega · devolución · inspección]
    MNT[ms_maintenance\nodómetro · historial · alertas]
    PRC[ms_pricing\ntarifas · coberturas · promociones]
    PAY[payments\ntransacción · refund\nMOCK/adapter real]
  end

  GW --> ID
  GW --> CAT
  GW --> INV
  GW --> ORD
  GW --> CNT
  GW --> MNT
  GW --> PRC
  GW --> PAY

  ORD -->|hold/confirm/release por API| INV
  ORD -->|quote snapshot| PRC
  ORD -->|charge/refund| PAY
  CNT -->|transición operativa| INV
  CNT -->|inspección/odómetro| MNT
  MNT -->|maintenance restriction| INV

  subgraph DBS[Database-per-Service objetivo]
    DBI[(db_identity)]
    DBC[(db_catalog)]
    DBV[(db_inventory)]
    DBO[(db_order)]
    DBT[(db_counter)]
    DBM[(db_maintenance)]
    DBP[(db_pricing)]
    DBPAY[(db_payments)]
  end

  ID --- DBI
  CAT --- DBC
  INV --- DBV
  ORD --- DBO
  CNT --- DBT
  MNT --- DBM
  PRC --- DBP
  PAY --- DBPAY

  OUT[(Outbox por servicio)]
  ORD --> OUT
  INV --> OUT
  CNT --> OUT
  MNT --> OUT
  OUT -->|retry idempotente| SYNC[InventoryStockService client]
  SYNC -->|PushStockUpdate 1/0\nStreamInventoryChanges\nGetSlotAvailability| BOOKING

  NOTE1[No FKs ni SELECT entre bases.\nIDs lógicos y snapshots contractuales.]
  NOTE2[Primera implementación: límites dentro del monolito.\nExtracción física sólo tras aprobación y parity tests.]
  DBS --- NOTE1
  DOM --- NOTE2
